	"smallSizeObservation": {
		"en": "At 128/64 px, the red cap, face and raised red-white ball remain clear. At 32/24/16 px, the compact silhouette and dominant colors carry recognition; fine material detail, printed marks and background lines naturally merge. Native source: 960 px; 1024/2048 exports are resampling, not new detail.",
		"zh": "128/64 px 能辨认红帽、面孔与举起的红白球；32/24/16 px 以紧凑轮廓和主色维持识别，精细材质、印记与背景线条自然合并。 原始素材为 960 px；1024/2048 为放大导出，不代表新增细节。"
	}
